      "message": "fix(multiaxis): rotary refusal names the 4-axis case\n\nA model that is not a shape of revolution refuses the rotary kinds.\nThe refusal pointed only at the 5-Axis kinds, which a 4-axis machine\ndoes not have. It now says that 4-axis work on a part clamped on A that\nis not turned is not supported yet, and names the issue. The words\n\"share no rotation axis\" and the 5-axis pointer stay.\n\nPinned by the_freeform_refusal_names_the_4_axis_case.\n\nRefs #2772\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
